# Bundler's gem path, at the repo root. Anchored with a leading slash: bare
# `vendor` matches a directory of that name at ANY depth, which silently
# swallowed assets/js/vendor/ — so the vendored Lunr was never committed and
# search 404'd in production while working perfectly in local preview.
/vendor
.obsidian/
